    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 40,
        "text": "Hi Mei, you look tired. Are you okay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2f7773e2c7ad9bafec6eb34b9da0c131dee4cd310508c3055298c12a012617c3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 44,
        "sourceEnd": 123,
        "text": "Yeah, I’m fine. I just finished swimming practice. The pool is very busy today.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "20be35850e152b34892e62a2b09cbacf163e1b7f9baadca8614a1a9864d69544",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 127,
        "sourceEnd": 162,
        "text": "Oh, I see. Why is the pool so busy?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "49578f143cfbf6b4d05b407eb55dfced7f4bf3ec4f9690936b08416e0ac4bf08",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 166,
        "sourceEnd": 244,
        "text": "Because the city swimming competition is next month. Many people are training.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "50a7ebcc23eed4d3d0c6c50e98e7bb738b07129a13da5bb1a2457668bc233896",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 248,
        "sourceEnd": 318,
        "text": "That makes sense. So, if you practice every day, you will swim faster.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ea038dff95fd9676d8c515359309b9ff615371438bd4214c9d4ae0b2d61710bd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 322,
        "sourceEnd": 403,
        "text": "Exactly. But I’m worried about the water. The pool water is not very clean today.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ae0ccb78374bb8a49d24495485cf0de691969e238df8ce136f431b7681db45f0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 407,
        "sourceEnd": 472,
        "text": "Really? That’s not good. If the water is dirty, you may get sick.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2bafb64b7a801b23566d2a1b2659097bec35cf78d7f74612c1a3883b032c85fb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 476,
        "sourceEnd": 555,
        "text": "I know. Therefore, I will talk to the coach. He should check the water quality.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f6537a70331c6e77cb4677e134f09d33cb9fa9a8e26ce5e316aa83b9e15d4534",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 559,
        "sourceEnd": 630,
        "text": "Good idea. Also, you should drink water after swimming. It’s important.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cde3ba5be08c3c0735533f47c12ad86aada4465e22697748fc0dd8b932d477e1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 634,
        "sourceEnd": 692,
        "text": "Yes, I always do. But sometimes I forget. I must remember.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8d42781742b0391273161be0657d6503feaaacd8e0dd861b03768bfeb2cfbe77",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 696,
        "sourceEnd": 774,
        "text": "And you shouldn’t swim immediately after eating. Wait at least thirty minutes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bb8e9114991cf7e58921f23a4d2bf0c68064db113ce3548f194854bad7707f30",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 778,
        "sourceEnd": 829,
        "text": "Thanks. I usually wait. But today I was in a hurry.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "c624ff34a8e7b0720d4a62966cc93b00262113a892dd41afbf341fe00d9c9da3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 833,
        "sourceEnd": 898,
        "text": "If you are in a hurry, you might feel uncomfortable in the water.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d412cc073bfec8aff0de8b451729a8921be6034b05ba15c9e79405c92858cdc4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 902,
        "sourceEnd": 949,
        "text": "You’re right. I will be more careful next time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "eb10bf834c40eb2d745a1171de1d8baa7f78642c7702a5e7b9cc6570c600f6e7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 953,
        "sourceEnd": 1025,
        "text": "Also, the pool changing room is very wet. You should wear sandals there.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c1270d59f205965a9f9d03e4e8ad53ed4a2c2e357900eb0b631853f45b772555",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 1029,
        "sourceEnd": 1082,
        "text": "Oh, I didn’t know that. I will wear sandals tomorrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b85353f19315a88a623ac61aaf41f7b4bf500cb0a3d4f6c97dd1da69e68af8fb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 1086,
        "sourceEnd": 1146,
        "text": "Great. And if you see any problems, you must tell the coach.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "57ef9302da46ab72d7d3db52ac889c65f6ea80315b45525cdbd87384b69b131e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 1150,
        "sourceEnd": 1186,
        "text": "Okay, I will. Thanks for the advice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8842ab037fd1b331235bed05c49bc2103c920ae2f1b37246a63c79b0759e9c4d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 1190,
        "sourceEnd": 1235,
        "text": "You’re welcome. Good luck with your training!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "34cef03ff84706791efdbc3a42465e1c46b769fa8434eafbe17e4719fc058d94",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
